{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f990bbdeb9bb1956839bd55e75ef2dec.avif?t=1756731694\" alt=\"says the word about, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.poster.avif?t=1756731694\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.webm?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.mp4?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On My Way Out</strong> is a heartwarming adventure game about a spinning top trying to watch the sunset with his friends. The problem - the front gate won't budge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Culver</strong>, who will have to spin, jump and dive through the obstacles the neighborhood contains in order to find a way out. Explore daunting paths through the surrounding forest, lakes and desert, uncover the secrets this world holds, recover stolen relics, and meet your neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.poster.avif?t=1756731694\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.webm?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.mp4?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/211f357a99cef6a718a4fe0536dca5fb.avif?t=1756731694\" alt=\"says the word feature, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Neighbors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know them that well, but that doesn\u2019t mean they weren\u2019t always out there. They might be able to help.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysteries to Muster</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world holds tight to it\u2019s secrets, but if you can crack the code, you can conquer the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Show Might Not Go On</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help recover museum relics or a neighbor\u2019s vision will be forgotten to time...again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oyster World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like an oyster, this world is what you make of it. Many paths can lead to the same destination, so explore to your heart's content. Good luck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.poster.avif?t=1756731694\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.webm?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.mp4?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"On display","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/fd2f8024da95f5f245b87ab3d6d9e33f176098a7.jpg"},{"name":"Thank you kindly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/ae5e1bb58121493010b1bb3ce47c8bcbf30be536.jpg"},{"name":"Locked away","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/4086e109213273d925c7f141cc795ce35723b1a5.jpg"},{"name":"Pocket change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/86d853fd6dd06fc083c3e5039993fe812cef0d45.jpg"},{"name":"Ruby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/6f3ee13228f116db23309f103625339a158202bc.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/24e389db02ed22982cb4cba76bbb5c606339db6c.jpg"},{"name":"Emerald","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/8ece25bc57a0b5b0be45ff68a08c0506aa43a424.jpg"},{"name":"Sapphire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/2b03cd31e859419ab966e3353b0e87133b414b16.jpg"},{"name":"Moonstone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/d60c67254f1dd80d4ac1f1a7e3142697a373e577.jpg"},{"name":"Can I buy a vowel?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868730/b262f0488f47c3a78e82f7d80e58e61b032dab77.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868730?t=1756731694","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstati