e sunset with his friends. The problem - the front gate won't budge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Culver</strong>, who will have to spin, jump and dive through the obstacles the neighborhood contains in order to find a way out. Explore daunting paths through the surrounding forest, lakes and desert, uncover the secrets this world holds, recover stolen relics, and meet your neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.poster.avif?t=1756731694\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.webm?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.mp4?t=1756731694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/211f357a99cef6a718a4fe0536dca5fb.avif?t=1756731694\" alt=\"says the word feature, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Neighbors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know them that well, but that doesn\u2019t mean they weren\u2019t always out there. They might be able to help.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysteries to Muster</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world holds tight to it\u2019s secrets, but if you can crack the code, you can conquer the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Show